WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:04.692
After registering through your invitation email, simply sign in to access the

00:00:04.692 --> 00:00:05.449
Supplier Portal

00:00:06.868 --> 00:00:11.069
You will land on your dashboard where you can Filter orders, track

00:00:11.069 --> 00:00:15.270
conversions, view insights by destination and nationality, and scroll down to access

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:16.670
your complete order list

00:00:18.354 --> 00:00:22.015
Go to Order Fulfillment to manage orders, with Propellus AI Assist helping

00:00:22.015 --> 00:00:23.846
you every step of the way.

00:00:25.518 --> 00:00:30.086
To Configure visa pricing and create agent-specific rates, go to Visa Offerings

00:00:30.086 --> 00:00:30.467
page

00:00:32.155 --> 00:00:34.981
From here, you can Update pricing for this visa variant

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:41.018
Now, click the Save button to confirm and store your pricing configuration.

00:00:42.615 --> 00:00:45.409
Toggle visa variants on or off for all agents.

00:00:47.161 --> 00:00:51.229
Now, click the "Disable Visa" button to confirm and disable the visa

00:00:51.229 --> 00:00:51.568
offering.

00:00:53.185 --> 00:00:57.478
Select Agent-Specific Pricing to edit pricing for individual agents.

00:00:59.202 --> 00:01:01.415
Click uncheck to remove default price.

00:01:03.119 --> 00:01:06.870
From here, enter a custom price for agent to override the default

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:07.182
pricing.

00:01:08.838 --> 00:01:12.969
Following that, click the Save button to confirm the agent-specific price update.

00:01:14.646 --> 00:01:17.928
Go to Travel Agents to view and manage the agents you work

00:01:17.928 --> 00:01:18.201
with.

00:01:19.888 --> 00:01:22.897
Enable or disable an agent using the toggle switch here.

00:01:24.521 --> 00:01:27.930
Select Manage to update pricing for a specific agent.

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:33.696
Following this, toggle off the accepting orders switch to disable this visa

00:01:33.696 --> 00:01:34.037
offering.

00:01:35.692 --> 00:01:39.154
You can Turn order acceptance on or off for this visa in

00:01:39.154 --> 00:01:39.730
manage section.

00:01:41.464 --> 00:01:45.599
You are also able to Add discounts and agent-specific pricing, then click

00:01:45.599 --> 00:01:47.322
Save to apply your changes.

00:01:48.986 --> 00:01:53.161
After that, you can view promotions page to create and manage campaigns.

00:01:54.769 --> 00:01:58.821
After that, you can view promotions page to create and manage campaigns.

00:01:58.821 --> 00:02:00.847
Here, you can view active campaigns.

00:02:02.569 --> 00:02:05.744
you can also create a new coupon code by clicking New Coupon

00:02:07.348 --> 00:02:10.770
You will be able to create and manage campaigns by assigning a

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:13.051
name, setting a budget, and choosing campaign dates

00:02:17.815 --> 00:02:21.280
To manage payments, click on payments and you will land on overview

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:24.744
tab from where you can track your current plan, revenue, visas processed

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:27.053
during this cycle, and your cycle end date.

00:02:28.772 --> 00:02:33.126
On payments page you can switch between tabs easily and view each

00:02:33.126 --> 00:02:37.479
section for detailed view. Click usage and billing to see detailed breakdown

00:02:37.479 --> 00:02:41.469
of visas by daily volume, destination breakdown and per visa cost.

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:46.756
Now, click the Pricing & Plan tab to view pricing structure and

00:02:46.756 --> 00:02:47.349
billing details.

00:02:49.013 --> 00:02:53.829
Here, you can review applied discounts, monitor visa volume, and offer add-on

00:02:53.829 --> 00:02:54.230
services

00:02:56.095 --> 00:03:00.102
Afterwards, click the "+ Add card" button to register a new payment

00:03:00.102 --> 00:03:00.436
method.

00:03:02.086 --> 00:03:05.756
In payment methods, yo can view your saved cards and securely add

00:03:05.756 --> 00:03:08.509
new payment methods whenever needed by clicking add card.

00:03:10.128 --> 00:03:14.480
Following that, click the Statements tab to review your financial statements and

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:14.842
records.

00:03:16.503 --> 00:03:20.386
Finally, visit the Statements tab to view your current and past billing

00:03:20.386 --> 00:03:20.710
statements.

00:03:22.353 --> 00:03:26.018
Now, click the SO account menu button to access your profile and

00:03:26.018 --> 00:03:26.629
account settings.

00:03:28.337 --> 00:03:32.547
To end, click your profile menu to access account settings and preferences.
